  "recordType": "rule-chapter",
  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Lot 2000 RULES OF MULTI-STATE LOTTERY ASSOCIATION GAMES\n\nStatutory Authority: RSA 284:21-i, VI and RSA 541-A:16, I(b)\n\nREVISION NOTE:\n\nDocument #12542, effective 6-1-18, readopted with amendments and renumbered Chapter Sw 5000 titled “Rules of Multistate Lottery Association Games” as Chapter Lot 2000. Chapter Sw 5000 had been adopted and filed by the Lottery Commission under Document #9698, effective 4-24-10.\n\nPursuant to 2004, 97:1-9, effective 7-10-04, the Sweepstakes Commission had been renamed the Lottery Commission.",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/lot2000.html"
